WEBVTT

00:18:56.154 --> 00:19:00.779
We see so much potential.
Please stay the course.

00:19:00.779 --> 00:19:03.951
I look forward to see you all
in India very soon.

00:19:03.951 --> 00:19:05.884
SRK: Thank you so much Sundar.

00:19:05.884 --> 00:19:09.831
(Applause)

00:19:09.831 --> 00:19:15.192
Sundar Pichai at 13,000 km,
with the help of this technology,

00:19:15.192 --> 00:19:18.042
is talking to us, without any lag.

00:19:18.042 --> 00:19:21.410
Such technology will keep increasing.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.816
One day he will be amongst us.

00:19:23.816 --> 00:19:26.606
Before we leave,
Sundar can I stand in front of you?

00:19:26.606 --> 00:19:28.409
SRK: Am I blocking this?
SP: No

00:19:28.409 --> 00:19:30.027
SRK: I am not blocking, Ok?